create a cli application that takes in information via connections and assign them as tasks for cli applications.

Example:
1. get incoming slack notifications from websocket connection to incoming feed
2. user process this task via this cli application (pipe notification to claude or other application)
3. task is added to working queue until it is finished
4. once task is completed add it back to incoming feed
5. you can continue on task (go back to step 3) or mark it as complete

